**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.dev.example
.git
.gitignore

# Defense-in-depth: never ship .env* files inside the build context.
# Today no Dockerfile uses `COPY .`, but if one is added the secrets in
# .env / .env.prod / .env.local would otherwise be baked into image layers.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
